OrangeIslands_Mikan_House3_Text_Veteran::
	.string "ORANGE CREW, thirty years. I kept\n"
	.string "the light on NAVEL.\p"
	.string "Due east of MIKAN and a long swim\n"
	.string "short of comfortable. Take the\l"
	.string "southern water, not the strait.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_House3_Text_Fisher::
	.string "He has told me about NAVEL every\n"
	.string "evening for eleven years.\p"
	.string "He is right every time.$"

